  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In-person and remote adjudication interview support to family class applicants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Uganda will support the Government of Canada to implement in person or remote interviews for family class applicants. IOM Uganda has long standing experience supporting resettlement operations in Uganda in coordination with relevant partners such as the Government of Canada, the Government of Uganda, as well as the refugee and migrant communities. IOM Uganda is able to provide high quality assistance with the required level of integrity to provide beneficiaries with timely information and implement interviews as required for application processing.</narrative>
  </description>
